,"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"0c4d4c618ed1","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"4420a9ce62b8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"France is the most successful team in Nations League history, winning 2 gold medals and 4 total medals. Russia also has 2 gold medals, but no other top-3 finishes. Poland has the most medals, with 5, including 3 bronze medals."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"8c7cbafd8ba3","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"2e881704624d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Which Teams Played in the Volleyball Nations League 2025?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"b8774a30c130","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"ce83e2af2bd4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Sixteen teams qualified for the Volleyball Nations League 2023:"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"fb9f51e5966a","_type":"table","asset":null,"rows":[{"_key":"61f11dcb-98c6-4d4e-8a9e-24349cc90f0c","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Team","Confederation","Best Finish"]},{"_key":"ef19f7cc-ea45-4e78-ab4d-fd1287b2e7cb","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Argentina","CSV","5th (2023)"]},{"_key":"edffcfe9-0237-4fc3-984b-8896371a02d0","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Brazil","CSV","1st (2021)"]},{"_key":"0cde6147-06ff-428e-a3d6-8137e83482a3","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Bulgaria","CEV","11th (2018)"]},{"_key":"daa98f84-fc39-43ca-8ba9-71e3c31717a9","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Canada","NORCECA","6th (2024)"]},{"_key":"172e9f99-6355-44c2-9942-fede66e94aa7","_type":"tableRow","cells":["China","AVC","13th (2022)"]},{"_key":"a1de2063-c379-40c0-af5f-97c68336b76a","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Cuba","NORCECA","9th (2024)"]},{"_key":"9535ba0a-9098-43bf-b51c-b040a47c6693","_type":"tableRow","cells":["France","CEV","1st (2022)"]},{"_key":"3a059ccc-d7c9-4bef-930e-8368079a9610","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Germany","CEV","9th (2018)"]},{"_key":"7d44815b-be74-4c62-b1fa-dac462806ad7","_type":"tableRow","cells":["Iran","AVC","5th (2019)"]},{"_key":"f05a16bd-64b3-4