ll,"children":[{"_key":"b2c9b092b338","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Swap between odds formats at any time while using Stake to choose the one you prefer. Here’s an example of how to read the 3 most popular types of soccer odds:"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c318a9f78c60","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"8e282e3203ff","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"How to read decimal soccer odds?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"fed02b1b5610","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"f22941c88d2e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"All you have to do is multiply the odds by your stake to understand how much you’ll receive from a winning bet."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"76167b491923","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"7471e27182e9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"As an example of calculating your payout from decimal odds, Aston Villa are 1.60 to beat Bologna. If you placed a $100 bet on Aston Villa and won, you’d get back $160, which would be your original stake, plus $60 profit."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"2b07a542da30","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"5bc16683b548","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Decimal odds are often the most popular because they’re easy to read and calculate payouts from."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"2a6940a84e7e","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"59031a583937","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"How to read fractional soccer odds?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"3226ed7290b6","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"5dabee826ef9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"To calculate payouts from your fractional odds, simply divide the top number of the fraction (numerator) by the bottom number (denominator), then multiply the result by your stake."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"6beeca1ef82d","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"c6d56d8dd065","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"As an example of calculating your payout from fractional odds, let’s look at Flamengo vs Independiente Medellin. Independiente Medellin are 11/1 to win. So if you bet $100 on them, you’d make $1,100 in profit, meaning you’d get back $1,200 in total."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"0af436b27998","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"b0a2068519c0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Fractional odds are a little more complex, but they tell you exactly how much profit you’ll make, rather than your total payout, so some users prefer them."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"a5109a9aab80","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"005c71f89326","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"How to read american soccer odds?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"499d5ce0ad64","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"4c3b02abe3c6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"American soccer lines, sometimes known as moneyline odds, are indicated by a 3-digit number next to either a + or - symbol. Whether a + or - symbol is used will affect how you calculate your payout."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c4ccbf77d807","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"ca3682048c27","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"For an example of American soccer odds, let's look at Nottingham Forest vs Burnley. Nottingham Forest are -192 to win, while Burnley are +520. When the - symbol is used, it shows you how much you'd need to bet in order to make a $100 profit. So if you bet $192 on Nottingham Forest and they won, you'd make $100. Meanwhile, if the + symbol is used, it shows you how much you'd win from a $100 bet. So if you bet $100 on Burnley, you'll win $520 in profit if they win the match."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"05ebe487c395","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"d5c6d8405531","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"How do live in-play soccer odds work?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"ab1d29c9688f","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"0f972a2a1083","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"If you’re looking for value in real-time, based on the current momentum and where you think the match is going, then "},{"_key":"babdc286b8a9","_type":"span","marks":["fb4f052d186b"],"text":"live soccer betting"},{"_key":"1c2ff873bdfa","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" is perfect. Take advantage of favourable odds based on the current state of play to potentially win big with the best odds or have an easy cash-out."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"fb4f052d186b","_type":"link","href":"https://stake.com/sports/live/soccer"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"726ba9e77858","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"a049063ee4ed","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Our guide to "},{"_key":"8d0ab3bf9fa8","_type":"span","marks":["3e6c16c76dc7"],"text":"live betting and pre-match betting"},{"_key":"83f653810405","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" shows some of the differences between in-play betting and pre-match betting, and how to devise the best betting strategy to win at Stake."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"3e6c16c76dc7","_type":"link","href":"https://stake.com/blog/live-betting-vs-pre-match-betting"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"eec5325bc924","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"2bc8d654530a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Key events that shift in-play odds"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"4db702faf7c4","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"1dc0546334d8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"While a soccer match is in play, the odds can change dramatically based on events that are happening on the pitch. These events include:"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"e236bd3a36de","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"c049ad92cf5f","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Goals - Goals have the biggest impact on live odds, as the scoring team will now have a higher chance of winning, particularly if they’ve gone ahead."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"737b16dcf8f3","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"73abdcbfcee8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Red cards - A team losing a player to a red card can be disastrous, giving their opponents a numerical advantage and making things much harder. Their odds will shorten as a result."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"84b2c205c6ae","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"f0947167d53a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Injuries - Injuries will affect the odds during the match. This includes injuries in which players eventually come back on the pitch after treatment."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"aa127b35f17f","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"51249678db02","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Penalties - A penalty is a high-probability goal-scoring situation, so the team awarded the penalty will suddenly have shortened odds of winning. If a team misses the penalty, it will also affect the odds."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"145022040d7e","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"0ac5829cf882","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Substitutions - Substitutions, including taking off or bringing on key players, usually have an impact on the live odds too."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"a10440be444e","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"b42de2a7d881","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Dangerous attacks - If teams sustain pressure over a long period, indicated by increased possession in their opponent’s half, their chance of scoring increases."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"60ab01f3e7b5","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"4064e17da164","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"How to read live odds movements on Stake"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"b4e2f8388298","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"981966ef9c58","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"During the match, you can use the live stats and pitch view, or watch the live stream if it’s available. You’ll also be able to see when the odds change, with a green arrow to show the odds lengthening and a red arrow to show the odds shortening."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"fb2eed1bc706","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"b2b7da33144f","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Note that at certain times of the match, the betting markets may be temporarily suspended. This typically happens immediately after a goal or other match event, which causes the odds to change. You won’t be able to place a bet while markets are suspended, but this only normally lasts a few seconds."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"9d924d173b7d","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"52551af2200b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Coverage of top football leagues and key tournaments on Stake"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"8d113592741a","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"25aabb8ab12f","_type":"span","marks":["711c63953681"],"text":"It's All at Stake"},{"_key":"6ad446f55d83","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" when it comes to the largest football events around! We cover every major soccer competition, including major European club competitions such as the "},{"_key":"c1f1d1b9a8ed","_type":"span","marks":["2ce3d9361d24"],"text":"Premier League"},{"_key":"133b95374b83","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", "},{"_key":"e2fd273d1962","_type":"span","marks":["801a8fc52571"],"text":"La Liga"},{"_key":"c4ac54d3ce7c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", "},{"_key":"9fa8d43c363f","_type":"span","marks":["34662918f5d5"],"text":"Serie A"},{"_key":"e7d4567a105c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", "},{"_key":"02e654317570","_type":"span","marks":["21230e7baeb2"],"text":"the Bundesliga"},{"_key":"6c03e54915cc","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" and "},{"_key":"daf5