ou can verify the licence at any time by selecting the CGB logo at the bottom of the page."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"d2e4ce5954c1","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"e34d2658e8cb","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Stake VIP program - rewards for regular players"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"dc24efc65191","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"dffe621b1105","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Thanks to the Stake "},{"_key":"56c64d61e65e","_type":"span","marks":["5383d270cee9"],"text":"VIP Club"},{"_key":"75a7d29ae634","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", you can level up your account as you place bets to unlock loads of exciting benefits such as regular rakeback, reload bonuses and even your own VIP host. Learn more about how to level up and unlock rewards on the "},{"_key":"3649fccc1e34","_type":"span","marks":["0e659592bc97"],"text":"VIP FAQ page"},{"_key":"bc063fdeffff","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"5383d270cee9","_type":"link","href":"https://stake.com/vip-club"},{"_key":"0e659592bc97","_type":"link","href":"https://stake.com/blog/stake-vip-program-faqs-help"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"efd5ca881a59","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"65c98936ce62","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"FAQ About Soccer Betting"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"f18376b77847","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"5079f799d52d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Is soccer an easy or difficult sport to be on?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"9be628b4bdc5","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"a41c6e5776e6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"It’s relatively easy to bet on soccer, with lots of matches and markets. However, it helps to understand the game and be aware of betting terminology. Our guides give you all the information you need to start."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"afa21bd73c50","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"7c6911aede20","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Can I bet on soccer games live?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"b135d52697c2","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"19df9fb7ab45","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Yes, live soccer betting is available at Stake. Simply log in and select a match while the live icon is shown to get the latest scores and live odds as they’re updated in real-time."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ef9808365b10","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"249ed164779c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Which soccer leagues offer the best betting markets?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"e452b7416037","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"804b627378e4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The biggest soccer leagues and tournaments, such as the Premier League, La Liga, the Bundesliga, and the Champions League, offer the widest range of betting markets. However, all soccer matches at Stake feature lots of markets to choose from."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"8f983d15bf3e","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"d2b247b6666e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Can I combine bets to improve my odds?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"3073a3ae52d8","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"4910d239b3b8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Yes, Stake allows you to combine bets to place parlays, also known as multibets. This will increase your odds, although each selection you make has to occur for your bet to win."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b2a1866d09b1","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"e75ca3a6b5b2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What are the safest bets in soccer?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"ad091cdb6ecb","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"0a0c34772af6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Soccer matches can be unpredictable, so there’s no truly safe bet. However, you can minimise risk by managing your bet sizes carefully. Follow our blog for predictions and analysis of major soccer matches."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ea4486e605bc","_type":"block","asset":null,"children":[{"_key":"eb23770d4c5b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"description":"Bet on soccer with the best football odds on major tournaments, from EPL to the World Cup! Place bets on UEFA with soccer betting promotions online now.","hreflangList":null,"language":"en","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"/sports/soccer"},"thumbnail":{"asset":null},"title":"Soccer Betting Online - Bet On Football With Best Odds"},"syncTags":["s1:PV7DEA","s1:MybOHw","s1:Z9yNZQ"],"ms":15}

requestBody:
{"query":"query SportBreadcrumb($sport: String!) {
  slugSport(sport: $sport) {
    id
    name
    slug
  }
}","variables":{"sport":"soccer"}}

{"query":"query SportIndex($sport: String!, $group: String!, $type: SportSearchEnum = popular) {
  slugSport(sport: $sport) {
    id
    name
    templates(group: $group) {
      id
      name
      extId
    }
    firstTournament: tournamentList(type: $type, limit: 1) {
      id
      name
      slug
      category {
        id
        slug
        name
        countryCode
      }
      fixtureCount(type: $type)
      fixtureList(type: $type, limit: 10) {
        ...FixturePreview
        ...UfcFrontRowSeat
        groups(groups: [$group], status: [active, suspended, deactivated]) {
          ...SportGroupTemplates
        }
      }
    }
    tournamentList(type: $type, limit: 5) {
      id
      name
      slug
      fixtureCount(type: $type)
      category {
        id
        slug
        name
        countryCode
      }
    }
    categoryList(type: $type, limit: 100) {
      id
      slug
      name
      countryCode
      fixtureCount(type: $type)
      tournamentList(type: $type, limit: 100) {
        id
        slug
        name
        fixtureCount(type: $type)
        category {
          id
          slug
          name
          countryCode
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

fragment FixturePreview on SportFixture {
  id
  ...SportFixtureLiveStreamExists
  ...FixtureOptionsSameGameMultiButton_SportFixture
  status
  slug
  name
  provider
  marketCount(status: [active, suspended])
  extId
  liveWidgetUrl
  widgetUrl
  data {
    __typename
    ...SportFixtureDataMatch
    ...SportFixtureDataOutright
  }
  tournament {
    ...TournamentTreeNested
  }
  eventStatus {
    ...SportFixtureEventStatus
    ...EsportFixtureEventStatus
  }
}

fragment SportFixtureLiveStreamExists on SportFixture {
  id
  betradarStream {
    exists
  }
  liveStream {
    data {
      isAvailable
    }
  }
}

fragment FixtureOptionsSameGameMultiButton_SportFixture on SportFixture {
  sgmAvailable: customBetAvailable
  swish: swishGame {
    sport: swishSport {
      sgmAvailable: customBetAvailable
      sgmLiveAvailable: liveCustomBetAvailable
    }
  }
}

fragment SportFixtureDataMatch on SportFixtureDataMatch {
  startTime
  isOutright
  competitors {
    ...SportFixtureCompetitor
  }
  teams {
    name
    qualifier
  }
  tvChannels {
    language
    name
    streamUrl
  }
  __typename
}

fragment SportFixtureCompetitor on SportFixtureCompetitor {
  name
  defaultName
  extId
  countryCode
  abbreviation
  iconPath
}

fragment SportFixtureDataOutright on SportFixtureDataOutright {
  isOutright
  name
  startTime
  endTime
  __typename
}

fragment TournamentTreeNested on SportTournament {
  id
  name
  slug
  category {
    ...CategoryTreeNested
    cashoutEnabled
  }
}

fragment CategoryTreeNested on SportCategory {
  id
  name
  slug
  sport {
    id
    name
    slug
  }
}

fragment SportFixtureEventStatus on SportFixtureEventStatusData {
  __typename
  homeScore
  awayScore
  matchStatus
  clock {
    matchTime
    remainingTime
  }
  periodScores {
    homeScore
    awayScore
    matchStatus
  }
  currentTeamServing
  homeGameScore
  awayGameScore
  statistic {
    yellowCards {
      away
      home
    }
    redCards {
      away
      home
    }
    corners {
      home
      away
    }
  }
}

fragment EsportFixtureEventStatus on EsportFixtureEventStatus {
  matchStatus
  homeScore
  awayScore
  scoreboard {
    homeGold
    awayGold
    homeGoals
    awayGoals
    homeKills
    awayKills
    gameTime
    homeDestroyedTowers
    awayDestroyedTowers
    homeDestroyedTurrets
    awayDestroyedTurrets
    currentRound
    currentCtTeam
    currentDefTeam
    time
    awayWonRounds
    homeWonRounds
    remainingGameTime
  }
  periodScores {
    type
    number
    awayGoals
    awayKills
    awayScore
    homeGoals
    homeKills
    homeScore
    awayWonRounds
    homeWonRounds
    matchStatus
  }
  __typename
}

fragment UfcFrontRowSeat on SportFixture {
  frontRowSeatFight {
    fightId
  }
  tournament {
    frontRowSeatEvent {
      identifier
    }
  }
}

fragment SportGroupTemplates on SportGroup {
  ...SportGroup
  templates(limit: 10, includeEmpty: true) {
    ...SportGroupTemplate
    markets(limit: 1) {
      ...SportMarket
      outcomes {
        ...SportMarketOutcome
      }
    }
  }
}

fragment SportGroup on SportGroup {
  name
  translation
  rank
}

fragment SportGroupTemplate on SportGroupTemplate {
  extId
  rank
  name
}

fragment SportMarket on SportMarket {
  id
  name
  status
  extId
  specifiers
  customBetAvailable
  provider
  templateExtId
}

fragment SportMarketOutcome on SportMarketOutcome {
  __typename
  id
  active
  odds
  name
  customBetAvailable
}","variables":{"sport":"soccer","group":"winner"}}

{"query":"query SportAllGroups($sport: String!) {
  slugSport(sport: $sport) {
    id
    allGroups {
      name
      translation
      rank
      id
    }
  }
}","variables":{"sport":"soccer"}}

{"query":"query ActiveSportPromotion($limit: Int, $offset: Int, $filters: GetActiveSportPromotionListFiltersInput, $includePromotionIds: [String!]) {
  claimed: sportPromotionUserClaimed
  active: getActiveSportPromotionList(
    limit: $limit
    offset: $offset
    filters: $filters
    includePromotionIds: $includePromotionIds
  ) {
    ...SportPromotionFragment
  }
}

fragment SportPromotionFragment on SportsPromotion {
  id
  isTargeted
  vipLevel
  betType
  description
  category: betCategory
  startsAt: startDate
  endsAt: endDate
  name
  type {
    code
  }
  specifiers {
    provider
    level: identifierEnum
    line
    lineType
    outcome {
      id
      extId
      name
    }
    stat {
      id
      name
    }
    market {
      ... on SportMarket {
        id
        extId
        templateExtId
        specifiers
        name
      }
      ... on SwishSportStat {
        id
        name
      }
    }
    competitor {
      ... on SwishCompetitor {
        id
        name
      }
    }
    data: identifier {
      ... on SwishSport {
        id
        slug
      }
      ... on Sport {
        id
        slug
      }
      ... on SportCategory {
        id
        slug
      }
      ... on SportTournament {
        id
        slug
      }
      ... on SportFixture {
        id
      }
      ... on SwishGame {
        id
        teams {
          name
        }
      }
    }
  }
  rule {
    min: minBet
    max: maxBet
    conditions {
      value
      tf: promotionTypeField {
        field {
          code
        }
      }
    }
    boostLadder {
      boost
      legs
    }
  }
}","variables":{"limit":40,"offset":0,"filters":{"type":"ENHANCED_PRICE"}}}

{"query":"query BetsBoard_HighrollerSportBets($limit: Int!) {
  highrollerSportBets(limit: $limit) {
    id
    iid
    bet {
      ...BetsBoardSport_BetBetHero
    }
  }
}

fragment BetsBoardSport_BetBetBase on BetBet {
  __typename
  ... on SwishBet {
    __typename
    id
    customBet
    updatedAt
    createdAt
    potentialMultiplier
    amount
    currency
    user {
      id
      name
      preferenceHideBets
    }
    outcomes {
      __typename
      id
      odds
